    "title": "Movie Trivia - Quiz Puzzle",
    "description": "Welcome to the ultimate Movie Trivia game! Here you will Relive the fun, entertaining and memorable moments in movies! Drama, comedy, horror, classics, action... Come on. Figure out how much do you know about films. \r\n\r\nPlay Movie Trivia show what your film knowledge! Relive the fun, entertaining and memorable moments in movies! Our exciting Movie Trivia is waiting for everyone whose favourite past-time is watching movies.\r\n\r\nHOW TO PLAY\r\n- Choose the correct answer from 4 options before time runs out.\r\n- Try a HINT to help you remove a wrong spelling option.\r\n- Use +20s to add 20 seconds if you want more time.\r\n- Find 3 correct words to pass a level.\r\n- You will get a gift every time you complete 4 levels.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- Easy and quick to play.\r\n- Free to play for all generations.\r\n- Answer over 3000 trivia questions!\r\n- Challenging questions that test your film knowledge.\r\n- Gain extra bonus\r\n- Play without internet connection.\r\n- Daily bonus gems for free hints!\r\n- Free trivia game to test your IQ and film knowledge!\r\n\r\nReveal the fun if you are a movie fan! Download best movie trivia quiz game now and start the most exciting Movie Trivia challenge ever!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the ultimate Movie Trivia game! Here you will Relive the fun, entertaining and memorable moments in movies! Drama, comedy, horror, classics, action... Come on. Figure out how much do you know about films. <br><br>Play Movie Trivia show what your film knowledge! Relive the fun, entertaining and memorable moments in movies! Our exciting Movie Trivia is waiting for everyone whose favourite past-time is watching movies.<br><br>HOW TO PLAY<br>- Choose the correct answer from 4 options before time runs out.<br>- Try a HINT to help you remove a wrong spelling option.<br>- Use +20s to add 20 seconds if you want more time.<br>- Find 3 correct words to pass a level.<br>- You will get a gift every time you complete 4 levels.<br><br>Features:<br>- Easy and quick to play.<br>- Free to play for all generations.<br>- Answer over 3000 trivia questions!<br>- Challenging questions that test your film knowledge.<br>- Gain extra bonus<br>- Play without internet connection.<br>- Daily bonus gems for free hints!<br>- Free trivia game to test your IQ and film knowledge!<br><br>Reveal the fun if you are a movie fan! Download best movie trivia quiz game now and start the most exciting Movie Trivia challenge ever!",
